sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant S as AgentService
    participant Cache as TTL-LRU Cache
    participant A as LlamaIndex Agent
    participant T as Retrieval Tool
    participant E as NVIDIA Embedding
    participant L as Nemotron 3 Ultra

    C->>API: POST /v1/chat
    API->>S: query + user/session scope
    S->>Cache: lookup(versioned key)
    alt cache hit
        Cache-->>S: answer + sources + citation audit
        S-->>API: cached response
    else cache miss
        S->>A: run with bounded workflow
        A->>L: plan / native tool call
        A->>T: corpus-specific retrieval
        T->>E: query embedding
        E-->>T: vector
        T-->>A: evidence JSON + stable citation IDs
        A->>L: grounded synthesis with citations
        L-->>A: final answer
        A-->>S: answer + tool events
        S->>S: validate citation IDs and coverage
        S->>Cache: store only valid grounded response
        S-->>API: typed response + provenance
    end
    API-->>C: JSON + X-Request-ID
